# TOKEN ECONOMY STUB (Layer 0 — always)

Full canon: @.cursor/rules/token-economy-core.mdc (§0.0–§0.15). **Read it** on any role command (`BACK *`, `FRONT *`, `INTEG *`, `IDEA PIPELINE *`) and **before** writing plan/gap/architecture/decompose artifacts (§0.0 + §0.0.1).

Cross-cutting. Restricts **format**, not **content**. Quality (TDD, review, edge cases) > economy when conflict.

## 0.5.1 Doc router (mandatory)

**FORBIDDEN:** read full index target as monolith — indexes are tables only.

**REQUIRED session load order (default IMPLEMENT/TASK/BUGFIX/QA):**

1. `memory-bank/activeContext.md` → **`load_now`** list (ONLY those files)
2. **IMPLEMENT (эпик):** work shard `decompose-*/sNN|eNN-*.yaml` (**включая `plan_contract`**) + `decompose-*/index.yaml` + analyze artifact path если в load_now
3. **Прочие режимы:** ONE work shard (`task` / `bugfix` / `qa`) из `load_now`
4. AC source = **work shard + `plan_contract`**. **Не** подставлять полный `plan-*.md` как monolith AC
5. **Plan jumps (IMPLEMENT HARD):** Read строки из `plan_contract.plan_jumps` и/или `Consumes: plan §FR-00N` — объём jumps = (end-start)*2 = 100% к изначальному scope (line 120-160 = 160-120 = 40 * 2 => jump 120-200); не весь plan
6. `load_if_needed` only when task requires
7. **NEVER** load `done — do NOT load` section files

**`load_now` FORBIDDEN (IMPLEMENT / QA / BUGFIX / TASK):** полный `memory-bank/**/plan-*.md` как monolith · «acceptance context = весь plan» · creative monolith без open CR · `tasks.md` / `systemPatterns.md` · `decompose-*/index.md` · `implement-*/index.md`

**`load_now` OK partial plan:** `plan_jumps` line ranges / `plan §FR-00N` / Consumes §N (не весь файл)

**`load_now` OK index:** `plan/decompose-*/index.yaml` (status). `index.md` — DECOMPOSE/AUDIT/ANALYZE coverage, не IMPLEMENT hot path.

**`load_now` OK для полного plan:** когда следующий режим **PLAN** / **DECOMPOSE** / **ANALYZE** / **AUDIT** и plan — объект работы.

**PLAN override:** follow that mode's `workflow-*-plan.mdc` inventory. Doc-router lean defaults yield to workflow PLAN steps + @.cursor/rules/token-economy-core.mdc §0.0.

Канон «где стоим»: `activeContext.md` (§Handoff + load_now) + `decompose-*/index.yaml` (прогресс). `tasks.md` — индекс эпиков. **Нет** `memory-bank/focus/`.

## 0.7 Handoff (HARD)

**activeContext ONE Handoff:** ровно один блок `## Handoff …` + ≤ один `## done` — на FINISH **Write весь файл** (не sandwich). Detail: @.cursor/rules/shared/finish-block.mdc · @.cursor/rules/shared/finish-doc-router.mdc

## 0.9 Approval gate — `implement this`

**Requires exact phrase `implement this`** (no typos, no translations): file create/edit/delete · git commit/push/branch · deploy/db/secrets/docker mutate · autonomous multi-file batches outside explicit role command · **любой** Write/Delete под `.cursor/rules/**` (даже внутри `BACK IMPLEMENT`, если path не в shard `files:`).

**Does NOT require:** role commands (`BACK IMPLEMENT`, …) для **prod-кода** в пределах §0.9.1 allowlist · read-only ops · analysis + change plan before approval.

Before requesting approval: list files, changes, commands, consequences.

## 0.9.1 IMPLEMENT scope lock (HARD — always on code modes)

Канон: @.cursor/rules/shared/workflow-implement-scope-lock.mdc

| HARD | |
|------|---|
| One session | один `epic_id` + один `step_id` из `activeContext` / `load_now` |
| Write/Delete | только paths из work shard `files:` + implement yaml текущего шага + тесты, занесённые в shard `files:` |
| Rules | `.cursor/rules/**` — **только** path в shard `files:` **или** user `implement this`; plan text «обновить workflow» **не** разрешение |
| FINISH purge rules | только FINISH prose → `mb-finish`; **не** переписывать процесс/gates |
| Pre-FINISH | scope check; out-of-scope → REVERT до Handoff |
| **FORBIDDEN** | auto QA/AUDIT; mass `completed` в index; удаление тестов без `deletes:` |

## 0.10 Session start / FINISH (summary)

Triggers: `continue project` · role commands · `PM INIT` (архив).

On start: `activeContext.md` → `load_now`; continue from current stage — do not re-run completed stages.

On FINISH: @.cursor/rules/shared/finish-doc-router.mdc — update `activeContext.md` (+ `tasks.md` index as needed). Session detail: @.cursor/rules/shared/context-session-economy.mdc

## 0.11 Integration verification (summary)

Every external ref in code — grep counterpart. Missing = **bug**. Mandatory in **BACK IMPLEMENT** and **BACK QA**. Detail: @.cursor/rules/token-economy-core.mdc §0.11

## 0.12 Spec-first replace (HARD)

**Always-on:** @.cursor/rules/spec-first-replace-hard.mdc — as-built is not spec; pydantic → JSON; replace-not-wrap; **wire-complete** (add→wire→enforce→purge); no optional SoT; no regex+enum hybrid. Purge + Kind I: @.cursor/rules/shared/workflow-legacy-fallback-cleanup.mdc

**Behavior-first (role modes):** @.cursor/rules/shared/workflow-behavior-first.mdc — plan nouns ∈ produces; no dilution; **layout_dilution** (Target layout / deferred Notes / Appetite Cut); **anti-minimal**; AUDIT **PLAN↔runtime** + architecture parity; ANALYZE hard gate (no deferred); QA smoke + `sot_enforce_scan` на gate/agent FR

## PLAN / gap / decompose write

**Never shorten** `plan-*.md` / `decompose-*/**` / `architecture/**` under chat brevity. Full rules: @.cursor/rules/token-economy-core.mdc §0.0 + §0.0.1
